{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":58,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["真正的禁食"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你要大聲喊叫，不可止息；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揚起聲來，好像吹角。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我百姓說明他們的過犯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向雅各家說明他們的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們天天尋求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樂意明白我的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像行義的國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不離棄他們上帝的典章，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我求問公義的判語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜悅親近上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：我們禁食，你為何不看見呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們刻苦己心，你為何不理會呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，你們禁食的日子仍求利益，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勒逼人為你們做苦工。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們禁食，卻互相爭競，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以凶惡的拳頭打人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們今日禁食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不得使你們的聲音聽聞於上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣禁食豈是我所揀選、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人刻苦己心的日子嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈是叫人垂頭像葦子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用麻布和爐灰鋪在他以下嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這可稱為禁食、為耶和華所悅納的日子嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我所揀選的禁食不是要鬆開凶惡的繩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解下軛上的索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使被欺壓的得自由，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折斷一切的軛嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是要把你的餅分給飢餓的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將飄流的窮人接到你家中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"見赤身的給他衣服遮體，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顧恤自己的骨肉而不掩藏嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，你的光就必發現如早晨的光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所得的醫治要速速發明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公義必在你前面行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的榮光必作你的後盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時你求告，耶和華必應允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你呼求，他必說：我在這裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若從你中間除掉重軛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和指摘人的指頭，並發惡言的事，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你心若向飢餓的人發憐憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使困苦的人得滿足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的光就必在黑暗中發現；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的幽暗必變如正午。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華也必時常引導你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在乾旱之地使你心滿意足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骨頭強壯。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必像澆灌的園子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像水流不絕的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些出於你的人必修造久已荒廢之處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要建立拆毀累代的根基。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必稱為補破口的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和重修路徑與人居住的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["守安息日者的報賞"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你若在安息日掉轉","poem":1},{"noteId":69},{"text":"你的腳步，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我聖日不以操作為喜樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱安息日為可喜樂的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱耶和華的聖日為可尊重的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且尊敬這日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不辦自己的私事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不隨自己的私意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不說自己的私話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就以耶和華為樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要使你乘駕地的高處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又以你祖雅各的產業養育你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親口說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":69,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：謹慎","reference":{"chapter":58,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/58.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/59.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/57.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}